WHAT THIS LICENSE COVERS

The MIT license above covers the source code and the documentation in this
repository: src/, tools/, docs/, CMakeLists.txt and README.md.

It does NOT cover the bundled game assets under 'data/'. Those are artwork and
maps from the Teeworlds and DDRaceNetwork projects and stay under their own
licenses - all content under 'data' is released under CC-BY-SA 3.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/), with the authors credited
per asset set. See data/LICENSE.txt for the details, and note that the
mapres art differs between the 0.6 and 0.7 asset sets even where the file
names are identical.

The screenshots in docs/screenshots/ are renders of maps made with that art, so
they carry the same CC-BY-SA 3.0 terms even though the rest of docs/ is MIT.

The libraries under 'external/' are separate works with their own licenses,
each kept in its own directory:

  nanovg    (git submodule) zlib license, Copyright (c) 2013 Mikko Mononen
  libsugarx (git submodule) MIT license, see its LICENSE file
  glad      generated loader, see the credits below

The system libraries linked at build time (GLFW, zlib, libzstd, OpenGL,
OpenSSL) are not distributed with this repository.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

CREDITS

The overall shape of this project is modelled on TWICE, an MIT licensed
Teeworlds server (Copyright (c) 2025-2026 TeeMidnight): the layout of src/, the
storage namespace and its filewriter, and the typed config module follow it.
Written anew rather than copied, but the design is its.

The glad loader under 'external/glad' is generated code (glad 2.0.8, OpenGL
core profile, no extensions) and carries its own license in the file headers:
gl.c and gl.h are SPDX (WTFPL OR CC0-1.0) AND Apache-2.0, khrplatform.h is the
Khronos permissive license (Copyright (c) 2008-2018 The Khronos Group Inc.). It
was generated once and committed here rather than generated during the build.

------------------------------------------------------------------------

The map format constants and structures are derived from Teeworlds and from
DDRaceNetwork, both released under the zlib license. Their copyright lines:

  Teeworlds Copyright (C) 2007-2025 Magnus Auvinen and contributors, with the
            additions of the Teeworlds Archive Project,
            Copyright (C) 2025-2026 Teeworlds Archive Project Contributors
  DDRace    Copyright (C) 2010-2011 Shereef Marzouk
  DDNet     Copyright (C) Dennis Felsing

DDRaceNetwork is not GPL licensed: the license.txt in the DDNet checkout is the
zlib text (the same wording as the Teeworlds one, including the three
restrictions about the origin, about marking altered versions and about keeping
the notice) prefixed with the three copyright lines above. The format handling
in this repository is an independent reimplementation written against those
projects' documented file formats, item layouts and reference implementations,
so that the maps this editor writes are byte compatible with their clients.
